# The planning documents used to be ignored here. They are tracked now, on 2026-09-11:
# development follows them, so they are the same account as the commit messages, one level
# up. What kept them out was never the reasoning in them - it was that they named absolute
# paths on the maintainer's machine and a private target project. Those are placeholders
# now, and scripts/hygiene.sh is what keeps them that way, on every commit a push adds.
